## About this page

This page provides guidance on how to contribute to this repository. Clear contribution guidelines help maintain the quality, reproducibility, and transparency of the codebase, in line with RAP (Reproducible Analytical Pipeline) best practices. Understanding these instructions is important for anyone wishing to engage with or provide feedback on this learning resource.

## Contributing

This repository does not accept external pull requests. If you have suggestions or feedback, please contact the maintainers directly.
